//	  	 Sky130 Fill Generation Routine	                //
// 		    Version 08 July 22, 2025			//
//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
//								//
//		Revision History				//
//								//
//  v08: 3 new FILLCELLs					//
//	 additional diff fill sizes				//
//	 poly in 3 pass						//
//	 more m5 sizes						//
//  	 MACROs for poly, m5 					//
//								//
//  v07d:  added MACRO for diff fill				//
//  v07c:  diff alt3 bigger shapes				//
//  v07b:  fix DRCs, diff alt3 (0.5 x 0.5)			//
//  v07:  alt diff fill generation in filler cells		//
//  v06:  place wider diff in PASS2				//
//  	allow diff fill to overlap nsdm / psdm border		//
//								//
//  v05h_alt:  m3/m4 1.34 spacing to capm/cap2m			//
//  v05h Last v05g version ("3rd try")				//
//	same as 2nd try but poly size now 0.72 x 0.72					
//
//  v05g diff & poly fill variations				//
//  v05f has new poly_diff_2_FILLCELL  2.96 x 3.02		//
//  v05e has only comment changes from v05d			//
//  v05d changed edge_expand for HV_all to 0.20			//
//  v05:  add more diff & poly fill after fill-cell	   	//
//	  increase HV keepout to avoid too close diff_fill 	//
//	  increase nsdm / psdm keepout  		   	//
//	  remove dill_fill straddling COREID		   	//
//	  increase LI fill size 			   	//
//  v04:  Release with DRC update v2.9				//
//  v03:  Tweaks to some fill sizes				//
//  v02:  Updates to comments					//
//  v01:  Initial release					//
//								//
//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

